{"video":"excInga21PE","lines":[{"t":[0.4,3.5],"en":"Spencer Shea somehow finds a way to set everything ablaze."},{"t":[3.6,5.3],"en":"And we mean everything."},{"t":[7.8,10.8],"en":"We're ranking the top ten biggest and most dangerous fires"},{"t":[10.9,12.4],"en":"that Spencer ever started."},{"t":[13.1,16],"en":"- Electrical wiring just isn't your thing. - No, it is not."},{"t":[16.9,18.8],"en":"- I thought your rollerblades broke. - They did."},{"t":[19.4,21.4],"en":"But I fixed 'em. Look it!"},{"t":[24.8,27.8],"en":"Yeah, I just tightened the toe bearings and lubed up the wheels."},{"t":[30,33.4],"en":"How? Do something!"},{"t":[36.8,39.8],"en":"Wait! Wait!"},{"t":[40.3,41.8],"en":"Melody, la, la!"},{"t":[56.3,57.3],"en":"Sweet!"},{"t":[60,62.8],"en":"Oh, come on, lady."},{"t":[62.8,63.8],"en":"It's okay."},{"t":[63.8,66.3],"en":"I'm going with 'em, so it's not like they won't have a responsible adult"},{"t":[66.4,68],"en":"making sure everything goes smooth."},{"t":[69.8,73.8],"en":"Please, please, please, please, put it out, put it out, put it out!"},{"t":[73.8,78.6],"en":"Please, please, please, put it out, put it out, put it out, put it out, put it out!"},{"t":[78.7,82.6],"en":"Please, please, please, put it out, put it out, put it out, put it out!"},{"t":[91.6,95.5],"en":"So, I'll make sure everything goes smooth in Japan."},{"t":[97.4,98.7],"en":"Okay, I'll fixed!"},{"t":[99.1,101.5],"en":"Which means I'm now officially a drummer."},{"t":[109.7,111.1],"en":"How did that even happen?"},{"t":[117.7,118.4],"en":"Nice."},{"t":[118.5,119.1],"en":"Watch this."},{"t":[119.1,119.6],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[119.6,120.1],"en":"Yeah."},{"t":[121.1,121.6],"en":"Aw."},{"t":[121.6,122.6],"en":"Come on!"},{"t":[122.6,123.6],"en":"What?"},{"t":[123.6,124.6],"en":"Oh, no!"},{"t":[124.6,125.6],"en":"Why?"},{"t":[128.6,129.6],"en":"What?"},{"t":[129.6,130.6],"en":"Oh!"},{"t":[130.6,131.6],"en":"Again!"},{"t":[131.6,132.6],"en":"I don't understand!"},{"t":[132.9,133.9],"en":"I don't understand!"},{"t":[142.3,148.4],"en":"Pull this thingy, point the nozzle suchly, and calmly squeeze this metal..."},{"t":[148.4,149.4],"en":"Oh, my God!"},{"t":[149.4,150.4],"en":"Oh, my God!"},{"t":[153.4,154.4],"en":"Girl, what do we do?"},{"t":[154.4,155.4],"en":"What do we do?"},{"t":[161.4,164.4],"en":"And then you just put the extinguisher back in its wall bracket."},{"t":[169.4,170.4],"en":"Do you smell something burning?"},{"t":[170.4,171.4],"en":"No."},{"t":[175.4,176.4],"en":"Ah!"},{"t":[176.4,177.4],"en":"Ah!"},{"t":[177.4,178.4],"en":"Fire!"},{"t":[178.4,179.4],"en":"Get the extinguisher!"},{"t":[179.4,180.4],"en":"Ah!"},{"t":[180.4,181.4],"en":"Ah!"},{"t":[181.4,182.4],"en":"They're gone!"},{"t":[182.4,183.4],"en":"Okay, everybody out!"},{"t":[183.4,184.4],"en":"Everybody out!"},{"t":[184.4,185.4],"en":"Go, go, go!"},{"t":[185.4,186.4],"en":"Whoa!"},{"t":[186.4,187.4],"en":"Oh!"},{"t":[187.4,188.4],"en":"This is so bad!"},{"t":[195.4,196.4],"en":"It's going..."},{"t":[196.4,197.4],"en":"Oh, my God!"},{"t":[197.4,198.4],"en":"Put it out, put it out!"},{"t":[198.4,199.4],"en":"It's drying!"},{"t":[199.4,200.4],"en":"Just shut off the smoke alarm!"},{"t":[200.4,201.4],"en":"Okay!"},{"t":[201.4,202.4],"en":"Wait!"},{"t":[202.4,203.4],"en":"How do I turn off the smoke alarm?"},{"t":[203.4,205.4],"en":"Use the pineapple!"},{"t":[214.4,215.4],"en":"Yeah!"},{"t":[215.4,216.4],"en":"There's a fire!"},{"t":[216.4,217.4],"en":"We know!"},{"t":[217.4,218.4],"en":"Shut up!"},{"t":[223.4,225.4],"en":"I think the sculpture's great."},{"t":[225.4,226.4],"en":"Do all the pieces still move?"},{"t":[226.4,227.4],"en":"You tell me."},{"t":[238.4,239.4],"en":"I..."},{"t":[239.4,240.4],"en":"I..."},{"t":[241.4,242.4],"en":"I love it."},{"t":[243.4,244.4],"en":"You do?"},{"t":[244.4,245.4],"en":"Absolutely!"},{"t":[245.4,248.4],"en":"It's about setting your old self on fire"},{"t":[248.4,251.4],"en":"and then rebuild it from the ashes like a phoenix."},{"t":[253.4,255.4],"en":"If you want to oversimplify it, sure."},{"t":[256.4,259.4],"en":"You know you really had me going with that whole world record thing?"},{"t":[259.4,261.4],"en":"But I guess that was just a part of it."},{"t":[261.4,262.4],"en":"Performance art!"},{"t":[266.4,267.4],"en":"Okay."},{"t":[269.4,271.4],"en":"Wasn't supposed to catch on fire, was it?"},{"t":[272.4,273.4],"en":"Never is."},{"t":[275.4,277.4],"en":"And I am very responsible no matter what you say."},{"t":[278.4,280.4],"en":"I know everything that goes on around here."},{"t":[282.4,283.4],"en":"Uh, guys?"},{"t":[283.4,284.4],"en":"What?"},{"t":[285.4,286.4],"en":"Fire!"},{"t":[287.4,288.4],"en":"Just yell, do something!"},{"t":[295.4,296.4],"en":"Yes!"},{"t":[301.4,302.4],"en":"Yes!"},{"t":[302.4,303.4],"en":"We have a kitchen fire!"},{"t":[303.4,304.4],"en":"Please, send help right away!"},{"t":[312.4,313.4],"en":"Ah, they just bought this bruise!"},{"t":[317.4,318.4],"en":"Hey, don't worry, we're just gonna go--"},{"t":[318.4,319.4],"en":"Quiet!"},{"t":[319.4,320.4],"en":"I'm saving your life!"},{"t":[320.4,321.4],"en":"Can't go with her!"},{"t":[321.4,322.4],"en":"Run, old man!"},{"t":[322.4,323.4],"en":"Run!"}]}
